E4x analysis: per-source drop and sync x B interaction, stage kind e4x

World bootstrap (2,000 draws, seed 996) of ContractValid per (stream, system), per source of
the triggering event and pooled, over all and over touched probes; the official - ideal drop per
system and the interaction [drop]_B=1 - [drop]_B=0, paired per probe and clustered by world;
state divergence per stream and source. The calendar interaction over all probes is reported
as the pre-registered primary result. Writes analysis/e4x_metrics.json; the e4x CLI analyses
after the run (--no-analyse to skip); stage.py merges split e4x runs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
